OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested as
OL,4,Acounter-terror police investigate major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men have been arrested and remain
OL,8,Fin custody as counter-terror police are
OL,9,Fleading an investigation into a major
OL,10,Fincident near RAF Fairford
OL,12,FThey were arrested on suspicion of
OL,13,Fcommitting offences under the
OL,14,FExplosives Act, police say, after the
OL,15,Fforce received a call at about 00:45
OL,16,FBST on Sunday morning relating to
OL,17,F"three suspicious vehicles" travelling
OL,18,Ftowards the base
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
