OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested as
OL,4,Acounter-terror police investigate major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt a news conference, Assistant Chief
OL,8,FConstable Richard Ocone says "work to
OL,9,Festablish the full nature of the
OL,10,Fincident is ongoing", as 85 homes have
OL,11,Fbeen evacuated
OL,13,F"It all happened very quickly. We just
OL,14,Fpacked our stuff up and came here,"
OL,15,Fsays one of the evacuated residents
OL,17,FHelicopter footage shows robots
OL,18,Fapproaching vans at the scene as a
OL,19,FBritish Army bomb disposal team is
OL,20,Fcarrying out operations
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34703
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1790515536
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested as
OL,4,Acounter-terror police investigate major
OL,5,Aincident near RAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,8,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,9,Fmilitary. The country's Air Force says
OL,10,Fit "remains vigilant" following the
OL,11,Fincident
OL,13,FThe context for this is troubling and
OL,14,Fcomes amid a rising number of incidents
OL,15,Facross Europe of what's termed "hybrid
OL,16,Fwarfare", our security correspondent
OL,17,FFrank Gardner writes
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
